				<pubDate>Wed, 16 Mar 2011 20:13:27 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Sorts</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>323478</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Finally got a chance to read this and it is excellent. Great concept, good danger, plenty of room for the imagination to go into over drive trying to figure it out.</p> <p>And no test logs yaaaaay.</p> <p>To clarify: Usually when I see an article as wonderfully open-ended as this there seems to be some great urge on the part of everyone to throw in test logs that squeeze out all of the mystery, so I am glad that is not happening here.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
